#. module: ai_mcp
#: model:ir.actions.server,ai_tool_description:ai_mcp.ir_actions_server_mcp_retrieve_initial_context
msgid ""
"\n"
"            Retrieves information about the current user, their timezone and "
"their companies.\n"
"            MANDATORY: You MUST call this tool exactly once at the very "
"beginning of every conversation, before invoking any other tool or producing "
"any response to the user.\n"
"            It returns essential context that is required to correctly use "
"every other tool: the current user, their timezone, their active company and "
"all companies available to them, plus general instructions.\n"
"            Skipping this call will lead to incorrect tool usage (wrong "
"timezone, wrong company scope). Do not call it more than once in the same "
"conversation.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"            检索有关当前用户、其时区及其所属公司的信息。\n"
"            必填：您必须在每次对话的最初阶段，在调用任何其他工具或向用户生成"
"任何回复之前，准确调用此工具一次。\n"
"            它返回正确使用其他所有工具所需的基本上下文：当前用户、其时区、其"
"当前所属公司以及其可访问的所有公司，外加一般性说明。\n"
"            跳过此调用将导致工具使用错误（时区错误、公司范围错误）。请勿在同"
"一对话中调用此工具超过一次。\n"
"        "

#. module: ai_mcp
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ai_mcp.field_res_users_apikeys_description__scope
msgid ""
"\n"
"        A token with scope 'A' can only be used for endpoints requiring a "
"bearer token of scope 'A' and\n"
"        can't be used for endpoints requiring any other scope than 'A'.\n"
"        "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        作用范围为“A”的令牌只能用于需要作用范围“A”的持有者令牌的端点，\n"
"        不能用于需要“A”以外任何作用范围的端点。\n"
"        "

#. module: ai_mcp
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_ai_mcp
msgid ""
"\n"
"- To connect to your Odoo MCP Server:\n"
"    1. Set the URL of the MCP server as the Odoo URL with the suffix /mcp. "
"For example if the Odoo URL 'https://example.odoo.com', the MCP Server URL "
"would be 'https://example.odoo.com/mcp'.\n"
"    2. Generate an API Key to use it as the authentication token with your "
"favourite MCP client:\n"
"        a. Login into Odoo.\n"
"        b. Click on the user avatar.\n"
"        c. Go to the security tab.\n"
"        d. Generate an API key. Set the scope as MCP.\n"
"- Important:\n"
"    1. NEVER share your token. Anyone who gets access to your token can use "
"the MCP server as if it was you.\n"
"    2. NEVER add your token in a text field on your MCP client. ALWAYS use "
"fields of type Credential or Password as they are encrypted.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"- 连接您的 Odoo MCP 服务器：\n"
"    1. 将 MCP 服务器的 URL 设置为 Odoo URL 并加上后缀 /mcp。例如，如果 Odoo "
"URL 为“https://example.odoo.com”，则 MCP 服务器 URL 为“https://"
"example.odoo.com/mcp”。\n"
"    2. 生成一个 API 密钥，用作您的 MCP 客户端的身份验证令牌：\n"
"        a. 登录 Odoo。\n"
"        b. 点击用户头像。\n"
"        c. 进入安全标签页。\n"
"        d. 生成 API 密钥。将作用范围设置为 MCP。\n"
"- 重要提示：\n"
"    1. 切勿分享您的令牌。任何获取您令牌的人都可以冒充您使用 MCP 服务器。\n"
"    2. 切勿将令牌填入 MCP 客户端的文本字段。务必使用凭据或密码类型的字段，因"
"为它们经过加密。\n"

